          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        rules: {
          objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest five-card poker hand at showdown.',
          gameplay: "After one hole card each, the dealer offers one card face up to the player to his left. That player may accept it or pay the agreed price to push it and receive the next card from the deck (must accept the second). The next player is offered the pushed card if the previous player pushed, otherwise a new card; same accept-or-push choice. This continues until all have received a card; any card pushed by the last player is discarded. Betting round begins with the player showing the highest hand. Three more rounds of offering and pushing (each starting with a fresh card to the first active player to dealer's left), each followed by a betting round. After the fourth round all active players have five cards (four face up). Showdown: highest hand wins.",
          keyRules: [
            'Push price (e.g. 5× minimum bet) must be agreed before play.',
            'Second card when pushing must be accepted.',
            "First card offered in each new round is always a fresh card from the deck to the first active player to dealer's left.",
            'Betting rounds are begun by the player with the highest hand showing.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Push only when the offered card is weak and the cost is worth the chance of a better card; otherwise accept and save chips for betting.',
          intermediate: 'Track which upcards opponents have; push more often when you need to avoid pairing low or when the next card could complete a draw.',
          advanced: 'Balance push cost against pot odds; use position to push selectively so the next player gets a card you know is bad for their board.',
          tips: [
            'Agree push price before the hand (e.g. 5× minimum bet).',
            'If the last player pushes, that card is discarded face down.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
